<title>GERMANY: Wayss says H1 grp construction output down.</title>
<headline>Wayss says H1 grp construction output down.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group construction output	     1,270   down 4 pct</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		   1,819   up 44 pct</p>
<p>    Group orders in hand		    4,100   up 14 pct</p>
<p>    Group workforce			   8,340   up two pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of German construction company is Wayss &amp; Freytag AG.</p>
<p>Wayss said it was aiming for an improvement in results during the second half of the year but that job cuts would be necessary.</p>
<p>The group said its incoming orders were boosted by a 260 million mark contract in Holland and a water storage project in Argentina.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
